</tr>

<tr>
<td class="org-left">Ganar “honestidad y confianza”</td>
<td class="org-left">Retórica electoral</td>
<td class="org-left">Imagen personal de Trump</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class="org-left">“Consultar” con extranjeros (Putin)</td>
